<title>JAPAN: Toyota shares set record high in morning.</title>
<headline>Toyota shares set record high in morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp shares climbed to a new high on Friday morning, still heartened by a media report on Thursday that the major automaker was planning a share repurchase, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price gained 70 yen to a lifetime high of 3,600 by 0207 GMT. Its previous high was set on Thursday.</p>
</text>
